============================================================
1. THE BUSINESS
============================================================

The business is a B2B marketplace/network built specifically
for the death-care industry.

The platform connects:

FUNERAL HOMES
CREMATORIES
FUNERAL DIRECTORS
REMOVAL/TRANSPORT PROVIDERS
TRADE EMBALMERS
EQUIPMENT SERVICE PROVIDERS
EQUIPMENT DEALERS
INDEPENDENT DEATH-CARE PROFESSIONALS

The platform has three primary functions:

1. POST A JOB
2. FIND/SELL EQUIPMENT
3. FIND A QUALIFIED DEATH-CARE PROVIDER

The long-term vision is:

"THE OPERATING NETWORK FOR THE DEATH-CARE INDUSTRY."

The app is the technology.

The network is the business.


