2. THE BIGGEST STRATEGIC CHANGE
============================================================

DO NOT launch by saying:

"Download our app."

DO NOT measure success by:

- Downloads
- Followers
- Website traffic
- Registered users

Measure:

- Jobs posted
- Jobs accepted
- Jobs completed
- Equipment listings
- Equipment transactions
- Repeat customers
- Revenue
- Provider response time
- Job fill rate

The business does not become valuable because people install
the app.

It becomes valuable when funeral homes depend on it to solve
real problems.


