3. THE INITIAL MARKETPLACE WEDGE
============================================================

The platform has two engines.

ENGINE #1:
DEATH-CARE SERVICES

This should be the primary launch engine because services
can create transactions faster than large equipment sales.

Examples:

- Removal/transfer
- Trade embalming
- Transportation
- Equipment repair
- Refrigeration service
- Preparation-room service
- Crematory service
- Vehicle service
- Temporary staffing
- Other legitimate death-care contract services

ENGINE #2:
EQUIPMENT MARKETPLACE

Examples:

- Embalming tables
- Preparation-room equipment
- Refrigeration
- Crematory equipment
- Funeral vehicles
- Caskets
- Urns
- Hydraulic equipment
- Church trucks
- Supplies
- Used equipment
- Facility equipment

The services engine creates frequent activity.

The equipment engine creates larger transactions and gives
people another reason to return to the platform.


