31. PAYMENT STRATEGY
============================================================

Use a legitimate marketplace/payment provider capable of
supporting your transaction model.

Do not casually promise "escrow."

Your payment flow needs to account for:

- Platform fees
- Provider payouts
- Refunds
- Cancellations
- Disputes
- Taxes
- Chargebacks
- Appropriate payment disclosures

Have the legal/payment structure reviewed before scaling
transactions significantly.


