You are connecting businesses/providers.

You need clear:

- Terms of service
- Provider agreements
- Customer agreements
- Cancellation rules
- Payment rules
- Dispute process
- Verification policy
- Privacy policy
- Appropriate insurance
- Independent contractor/business relationship language
- Jurisdiction-specific compliance

Have qualified legal counsel review the actual operating model.


